    "title": "Perfect Cream: Cake Games",
    "description": "Is perfect topping an easy task for you? Master the controls and try to prove everyone who is the chef in Perfect Cream game!\r\n\r\nHow to play Perfect Cream arcade games:\r\n\r\nYour task as a confectioner in arcade game is to add cream and decorations to desserts in such a way that not a drop of cream is lost! Hold the dispenser button to drop cream and try to match desserts. \r\n\r\nWhy you'll love Perfect Cream: Cupcake casual games:\r\n - Bright 3D arcade graphics\r\n - Simple arcade controls\r\n - Fun and unique arcade gameplay\r\n - Hundreds of challenging arcade levels\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ll certainly like Perfect Cream arcade games if you also like icing on the dress, cake doodle and cake decorating games!\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Download Perfect Cream cupcake games and become the best confectioner in casual arcade games!\r\n\r\n=====================\r\n<strong>COMPANY COMMUNITY:</strong> \r\n=====================\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/AzurGamesOfficial\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/azur_games\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
